{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36831","headline":"寄酬邺王罗令公五首 四 · 罗隐","name":"寄酬邺王罗令公五首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水云开霁立高亭，依约黎阳对福星。\n只见篇章矜镂管，不知勳业柱青冥。\n早缘入梦金方砺，晚爲传家鼎始铭。\n鹤髪四垂烟阁远，此生何处拜仪形。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36831.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36831","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}